  "question": "When a worker's skills make him valuable to the state, why should that value entitle the state to take away his choice?",
  "zhQuestion": "当一个人的本领对国家十分重要，国家是否就有权替他决定应当把这些本领用在哪里？",
  "limits": "Impressment varied by legal exemptions and historical period. Naval records establish coercive authority, not individual sailors' inner responses.",
  "zhLimits": "强制征募的适用范围和豁免因年代而异。制度资料能够证明国家拥有强制征募权，却不能说明每位水手如何看待自己的处境。",
  "methodEn": "Draws on parliamentary history and archives of impressment. The gallery describes the everyday position of men subject to recruitment rather than a single mutiny.",
