  "question": "If the job that feeds a man's children also controls his movements and home, how freely can he decide to refuse it?",
  "zhQuestion": "如果养活孩子的工作也决定父亲住在哪里、何时回家，他究竟能够在多大程度上自由拒绝这份工作？",
